<section class="pb-30 pt-20">
	<div class="container cls-px-xl-0">
		<div class="mt-20 row justify-content-center blocks">
			<div class="col-12">
				<div class="mb-20">
				<h2 class="small">Frequently asked questions when using TTSFree</h2>
				<p class="mt-20">
				Below are some common questions and answers. If you can't find your answer, please email us at support@ttsfree.com. We will reply you soon.
				</p>
				</div>
				<div id="accordion" class="myaccordion">
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-header d-flex px-4 py-2 align-items-center justify-content-between btnv btn-link" id="headingOne" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
							<div class="heading d-flex align-items-center">
								<h3>What is TTS?</h3>
							</div>
							<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
								<i class="fa" aria-hidden="true"></i>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="collapseOne" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne">
							<div class="card-body p-4 pt-md-3">
								<p>TTS is the abbreviation for Text to Speech, a technology text-to-speech. It has different applications, both free and paid. It can be used to create voiceover for videos, convert text documents into voices or help people with vision problems have can "read" the text.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div><!--	/	#Card	-->
					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-header d-flex px-4 py-2 align-items-center justify-content-between btnv btn-link" id="headingTwo" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
							<div class="heading d-flex align-items-center">
								<h3>What is the best free text to speech (software, apps ) ?</h3>
							</div>
							<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
								<i class="fa" aria-hidden="true"></i>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="collapseTwo" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingTwo">
							<div class="card-body p-4 pt-md-3">
								<p>Free text to speech apps to convert any text to audio.<br>
								The best free text to speech software has a lot of use cases in your computing life.<br>
								The best free text-to-speech program or software can convert your text into voice/speech with just a few seconds. We suggest some listings of the best free text-to-speech that provides natural sound for your project.
								</p>
								<ul>
									<li>#1 TTSFree.com</li>
									<li>#2 Fromtexttospeech</li>
									<li>#3 Natural Reader</li>
									<li>#4 Google Text-to-Speech</li>
									<li>#5 Microsoft Azure Cognitive</li>
									<li>#6 Notevibes</li>
								</ul>
								<h4>Best text to speech ai:</h5>
								<p>We use the best AI from Google Cloud, Microsoft, Amazon Polly, Watson IBM Cloud and several other sources</p>
							</div>
