					<div class="card">
						<div class="card-header d-flex px-4 py-2 align-items-center justify-content-between btnv btn-link" id="heading_collapseTTS_4" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseTTS_4" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseTTS_4">
							<div class="heading d-flex align-items-center">
								<h3>How do text to speech programs work?</h3>
							</div>
							<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
								<i class="fa" aria-hidden="true"></i>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="collapseTTS_4" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="heading_collapseTTS_4">
							<div class="card-body p-4 pt-md-3">
								<p>Most of the text to speech tools work similarly. You have to type the text you want to convert to voice or upload a text file. Then you have to select the voices available and preview the audio. Once you find the most suitable voice, you can download the mp3 file.
								</p>
								<p>See this article for more information: <a href="https://ttsfree.com/how-to.html" target="_blank" title="Step-by-Step Guide to Converting Text to Speech">Step-by-Step Guide to Converting Text to Speech</a></p>
							</div>
						</div>
